    ],
    "weaknesses": [
        "The theoretical foundation and algorithmic description are inconsistent and lack rigour. Key equations are presented as multiplicative perturbations but the algorithm and motivation seem to imply additive perturbations, causing confusion about the core attack mechanism.",
        "The claimed linear complexity O(T × τ) for Algorithm 1 is unsubstantiated and appears incorrect given the nested loops and independent loss computations for each candidate time step, suggesting a much higher query complexity that is not analyzed."
    ],
    "weakness_details": [
        {
            "weakness": "The theoretical foundation and algorithmic description are inconsistent and lack rigour. Key equations are presented as multiplicative perturbations but the algorithm and motivation seem to imply additive perturbations, causing confusion about the core attack mechanism.",
